Add a binding and driver for the Samsung S5KGW1P main image sensor used
on the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q).

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

Miroslav Mráz (2):
  dt-bindings: media: add Samsung S5KGW1P
  media: i2c: add Samsung S5KGW1P sensor driver

